.TH PSModelGetStatus 3 2023-12-09 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSModelGetStatus\fR \- Get the status of model

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/psyc.h>

.I
int  
.br
\fBPSModelGetStatus\fR(\fIPSModel *model\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Get the value of \fIstatus\fR of \fImodel\fR. If \fImodel\fR is part of a multi-model chain, the function will retrieve the status of the first model of the chain.
.br
Common status values are:
.br

.RS 4
.TP
.B PS_STATUS_UNTRAINED

.br

.TP
.B PS_STATUS_TRAINED

.br

.TP
.B PS_STATUS_TRAINING

.br

.TP
.B PS_STATUS_VALIDATING

.br

.TP
.B PS_STATUS_PAUSED

.br

.TP
.B PS_STATUS_ABORTED

.br

.TP
.B PS_STATUS_ERROR

.RE
.RE


.SH RETURN VALUES
The status of \fImodel\fR or 0 if \fImodel\fR is \fINULL\fR.

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1), PSModelSetStatus(3)
